WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.138
- [Kelly] Did you enjoy
doing "Good Burger 2"?

00:00:02.138 --> 00:00:03.804
- [Kenan] I loved it.
- [Kelly] Yeah?

00:00:03.804 --> 00:00:04.662
- [Kenan] Oh my gosh.
Shout out to Kel Mitchell.

00:00:04.662 --> 00:00:05.495
- [Kelly] Kind of cool to like...

00:00:05.495 --> 00:00:06.328
Yeah, he was here.

00:00:06.328 --> 00:00:07.290
So wait, doing it like years later.

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.250
That's so awesome.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.083
- [Kenan] It's amazing.

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:12.802
I mean, a 26 year gap is just
like really hard to imagine.

00:00:12.802 --> 00:00:13.635
(audience laughs)

00:00:13.635 --> 00:00:14.468
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:00:14.468 --> 00:00:15.301
- [Kenan] But you know,

00:00:15.301 --> 00:00:16.200
we both look very young still,

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.144
so that's good.

00:00:17.144 --> 00:00:17.977
(Kelly and audience laughs)

00:00:17.977 --> 00:00:19.830
And people seem to enjoy the movie,

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:21.120
so like we couldn't be prouder.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.890
Like it was a great response

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.870
and you know, great support from Paramount

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:27.540
and Nickelodeon and it
just feels really good.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.740
We did the parade.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:29.573
- [Kelly] I know!

00:00:29.573 --> 00:00:30.406
I gonna ask you about that.
- [Kenan] Riding in

00:00:30.406 --> 00:00:31.239
the Good Burger mobile.

00:00:31.239 --> 00:00:32.072
- [Kelly] Did you like doing that?

00:00:32.072 --> 00:00:32.905
'Cause I've done the parade
before and it's cold.

00:00:32.905 --> 00:00:33.738
- [Kenan] It is cold.

00:00:33.738 --> 00:00:34.571
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:34.571 --> 00:00:35.404
- [Kenan] But it was incredible.

00:00:35.404 --> 00:00:36.300
It's so much love.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.530
And you forget,

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:39.690
New York is full of
buildings that, you know,

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:42.150
are very tall and there's
people in the windows

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:43.140
like all the way up.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:46.050
So like riding for a
mile through the middle

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:48.060
of the city with people
just waving and smiling.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:48.893
It was incredible.

00:00:48.893 --> 00:00:50.400
Like, yeah, that was us out there.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:51.630
And shout out to those mechanics

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:53.305
'cause they got that car
to work the whole time.

00:00:53.305 --> 00:00:55.327
(audience laughs)

00:00:55.327 --> 00:00:56.460
- [Kelly] It always like, it looks good,

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:57.450
but like, will it run?

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:58.350
- [Kenan] Yeah, it is an older car.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:00:59.183
So yeah.

00:00:59.183 --> 00:01:00.360
They did a good job.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.040
- [Kelly] What was like your favorite,

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:02.873
I asked Kel this,

00:01:02.873 --> 00:01:04.110
what was your favorite burger place?

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:06.780
Like as a kid or even
now, what's your favorite?

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:08.220
- [Kenan] Growing up,

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:12.816
I feel like I was big on McDonald's.

00:01:12.816 --> 00:01:13.649
(audience laughs)

00:01:13.649 --> 00:01:14.482
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:01:14.482 --> 00:01:15.750
My son is addicted.

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:16.583
- [Kenan] Yeah.

00:01:16.583 --> 00:01:17.730
And then I went to LA and tried In &amp; Out

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:18.563
and that was good.

00:01:18.563 --> 00:01:19.396
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:19.396 --> 00:01:21.180
- [Kenan] But I don't
eat red meat anymore,

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:22.860
so we tried Hart House recently

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:23.940
and that was really good.

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:25.352
Kevin Hart's spot.

00:01:25.352 --> 00:01:26.185
- [Kelly] I don't know,

00:01:26.185 --> 00:01:27.720
I didn't eat red meat for like one year

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.428
and it was the saddest year of my life.

00:01:29.428 --> 00:01:30.261
(audience laughs)

00:01:30.261 --> 00:01:31.094
- [Kenan] Yeah.

00:01:31.094 --> 00:01:31.927
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:31.927 --> 00:01:33.068
- [Kenan] It's a dearly departed friend.

00:01:33.068 --> 00:01:33.901
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:34.980
- [Kenan] And you know,
I look at my friends

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.510
kind of like the little kid looking

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:38.100
from the window that can't go outside.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:38.933
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:38.933 --> 00:01:39.766
(audience laughs)

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:40.599
That's like when I see my friends

00:01:40.599 --> 00:01:41.790
having a milkshake.

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:42.750
'Cause I'm lactose intolerant

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:44.708
and I'm just like, just
tell me can I smell it?

00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:45.541
- [Kenan] That's tough.

00:01:45.541 --> 00:01:46.770
There's no alternative?

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:47.670
- [Kelly] I mean, there is.

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:48.720
Is it as good?

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:49.553
No.

00:01:49.553 --> 00:01:50.386
- [Kenan] So why even go there?

00:01:50.386 --> 00:01:51.219
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:51.219 --> 00:01:52.052
- [Kenan] I feel you.

00:01:52.052 --> 00:01:52.885
- [Kelly] Get out here.
- [Kenan] I feel you.

00:01:52.885 --> 00:01:54.990
- [Kelly] Yeah, I tried
like lactose free eggnog

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.670
this like holiday season.

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:57.503
- [Kenan] Like why?

00:01:57.503 --> 00:01:58.336
- [Kelly] Get outta here.

00:01:58.336 --> 00:01:59.700
- [Kenan] Nobody wants just nog.

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:01.613
- [Kelly] Yeah, there's no segue there.

